      en: ["Al Jurf is located approximately 150 kilometers off Libya's west coast.", "Commercial oil production officially commenced in 2003.", "It is operated by Mabruk Oil Operations (NOC, Total, Wintershall).", "The field uses the FPSO vessel 'Farwah' for offshore operations.", "The field is located within the C137 maritime concession block.", "It is situated close to the maritime border between Libya and Tunisia."],
