      en: ["Nafoora is located in the northeastern Sirte Basin near Gialo.", "The oil field was discovered in 1965 during early exploration.", "It is operated by the Arabian Gulf Oil Company (AGOCO).", "Crude oil is transported to the Zueitina terminal for global export.", "The field features a complex multi-layered reservoir system.", "It provides essential energy support to nearby desert communities."],
