      en: ["Mellitah is the starting point of the 520km Greenstream pipeline.", "It is managed as a joint venture between Libya's NOC and Italy's Eni.", "The plant receives gas from the Wafa field via a 540km pipeline.", "It is located approximately 80 kilometers west of the capital, Tripoli.", "The facility produces treated gas, LPG, condensates, and solid sulfur.", "It is a key part of the Western Libya Gas Project initiated in 2004."],
